OL,3,AKenya discharges last Ebola patient in
OL,4,Amajor milestone towards virus-free
OL,5,Astatus
OL,6,
OL,7,FKenya has discharged its last Ebola
OL,8,Fpatient - the seventh to recover from
OL,9,Fthe virus - marking a major milestone
OL,10,Fin efforts to contain the disease in
OL,11,Fthe East African nation, which now
OL,12,Fbegins a 42-day countdown to officially
OL,13,Fbeing declared Ebola-free.
OL,15,FIt had confirmed its first ever case of
OL,16,FEbola early in October when a Kenyan
OL,17,Fbusinessman died within days of
OL,18,Farriving in the capital, Nairobi.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,319,300,200,140,0,100
