OL,3,AKenya discharges last Ebola patient in
OL,4,Amajor milestone towards virus-free
OL,5,Astatus
OL,6,
OL,7,FHe had contracted the virus in the
OL,8,FDemocratic Republic of Congo, where
OL,9,Fmore than 5,000 people have died in an
OL,10,Fongoing outbreak that began in May. His
OL,11,Fmother also subsequently died.
OL,13,FKenya's health minister said 135
OL,14,Fidentified contacts of the infected
OL,15,Fpatients had also completed their 21
OL,16,Fdays in isolation.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
